**`name`-only upsert guard prevents anthropic models from receiving the new image/attachment defaults.**

For existing anthropic entries, names are unchanged, so Lines 79-82 skip updates and leave stale `attachment/modalities` values in place.


<details>
<summary>Suggested fix</summary>

```diff
+function shouldRefreshManagedModel(existing, def) {
+  if (!existing) return true;
+  return (
+    existing.name !== def.name ||
+    existing.attachment !== def.attachment ||
+    existing.tool_call !== def.tool_call ||
+    existing.temperature !== def.temperature ||
+    existing.reasoning !== def.reasoning ||
+    JSON.stringify(existing.modalities) !== JSON.stringify(def.modalities) ||
+    JSON.stringify(existing.limit) !== JSON.stringify(def.limit)
+  );
+}
