![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The regular expressions used to extract the API key and secret are quite fragile. They assume double quotes and no spaces around the assignment operator. Using a more flexible pattern would make the credential loading more robust to variations in the `credentials.sh` file format.

```suggestion
  const apiKey = content.match(/HF_API_KEY\s*=\s*["']([^"']+)["']/)?.[1];
  const apiSecret = content.match(/HF_API_SECRET\s*=\s*["']([^"']+)["']/)?.[1];
```

